# Copy to .env.local (gitignored). On Vercel, set these under Settings > Environment Variables instead.
# Supabase project URL and anon (or publishable) key, from Dashboard > Project Settings > API Keys.
# Safe to ship to the browser; used only for sign-in.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (public), from Cloudflare > Turnstile > your widget. Leave empty while CAPTCHA is off in Supabase.
# Add localhost to the widget's hostnames: once CAPTCHA is on in Supabase it covers local sign-in too, and Cloudflare's
# test keys won't pass there because Supabase holds the one real secret.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
# Default /api goes through the Vite dev proxy to http://localhost:8000. Set a full URL only for a deployed API.
# VITE_API_URL=/api
